# Scene flow architecture (pointer)

Full law: [`docs/docs/architecture/scene-flow.md`](../../docs/docs/architecture/scene-flow.md).

**Permanent decision:** boot scene `game-manager` owns Title → Character Create
→ Starting Scene (and `openSpaceSceneId` / world defaults). One pure precedence
rule (`resolveSceneFlowStep`); Title/Create do not own a competing pipeline.
In-play place changes are markers only — [Game loop](../../docs/docs/architecture/game-loop.md),
[Multiplayer](../../docs/docs/architecture/multiplayer.md). Boot picks starting
system; Warp Gate changes system during play.

When changing boot, Game Manager hops, `SceneEntryFlow`, or entry precedence,
read the full doc first. Also listed in `AGENTS.md`.
